      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have some avatars with a wrist band on it that does not appear when toggled, but other people seem to see it (avtr_341e10d4-ee9f-4a15-a434-fbfd5ffae18c). I've narrowed it down to only being this issue on the open beta (build 1583), as I am able to see it on regular version of VRChat (Build 1568) or within Unity.\n\nThis isn't consistent across all of my avatars, because I have other avatars with the same wrist band that appears for both myself and others, regardless if live or beta versions of VRChat (avtr_d4737dc2-3362-46bf-b3ee-0b6ba8d2b90d).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
