      "mergeID": "67b48ca241b07da7cba1cb51",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I have a pair of red rimless glasses that I have on multiple avatars which are on the head bone that are on by default and have a toggle to be turned off. However in the beta the glasses do not appear. \n\nThis is happening across multiple avatars that I haven't updated in weeks. These objects cannot be seen both locally and remotely in the beta however I have confirmed with a friend and personally that this issue is not present in the non-beta build.\n\nIt is strange because I have other objects linked to my head bone as well and they don't have issues.\n\nEdit: I have come across some other objects that're doing this, which are also on the head bone.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1582]Specific objects not appearing on avatar in beta but can still be seen by non-beta users",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "67af821c170ebf59305b10f9",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
